    "allUnknownPortfolioWithoutCap": 50988901.91549449,
    "reductionFactor": 1.569240536444581,
    "knownAnswerPortfolio": 763724.9295160627,
    "note": "The cap only reduces the effective widening factor, so an assessment whose answers are all known is unaffected."
